msgid "Automatically normalize only RGB channels whose preview values fall outside the 0 to 1 range. In-range maps and shader previews remain unchanged"
msgstr "仅自动归一化预览值超出 0 到 1 范围的 RGB 通道。范围内的贴图和着色器预览保持不变"

