#: __init__.py:1273
msgid "Draw preview thumbnails in the Shader Editor. Also follows the editor's own Overlays toggle"
msgstr "在着色器编辑器中绘制预览缩略图。同时跟随着编辑器自身的叠加层开关"

#: __init__.py:151
